            <ArticleTitle>[Intercostal neurinoma as a cause of recurrent chest pain].</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>5310-1</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>A case history of an intercostal neurilemmoma as a cause of recurrent chest pain in a young asthma patient is presented. The pathophysiology of the neurilemmoma is summarized and its role in the differential diagnosis of chest pain is shortly discussed.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
